<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Bio-Rad cut to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Bio-Rad cut to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said analyst Kevin Tang reduced the rating on Bio-Rad Laboratories Inc to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- shares were unchanged at 32-5/8 on Thursday.</p>
</text>
